models.description:
Password reset tokens for super administrators. Stores unique reset tokens with expiration dates to allow secure password recovery. Each token is single-use and expires after a set time window to maintain security. References the superAdministrator actor via foreign key to economic_board_administrators.

This table is essential for authentication workflows and follows the session pattern: ephemeral tokens tied to actor authentication state, managed entirely by system logic, not direct user interaction.

